  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "5",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EZR 5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono ekaba ng’a ase erieta ria Nyasae, oyore Omonene obo, ababani Hagai na Zakaria bw’ororeria rwa Ido mbaabaanete ase Abayahudi abamenyete ase ense ya Yuda na Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Serubabeli, mosinto o Sealitieli, na Yesua, mosinto o Yosadaki, bagachaaka koagacha naende enyomba ya Nyasae agwo Yerusalemu, na ababani ba Nyasae mbarengeo amo nabarabwo ase okobakonya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase engaki eyio Tatenai, omogabana bw’orogongo orwo rwa bosongo y’orooche rw’Eufarati, na Setari‐Bosenai, na abande babwataine nabwo, bagacha, bakababoria, “Ning’o obaa ribaga mokoagacha enyomba eye na gokoora koagacha orwaki orwo?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende bakabooria iga, “Abaagachi b’oboagacho obo, naki bakorokwa?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende eriso ria Nyasae obo nigo riarenge ririgereretie abagaaka b’Abayahudi, na abanto baria tibaabatangete goika amang’ana aria amoikere Dario. Magega y’ayio bairanerigwe ase riruube igoro y’amang’ana ayio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase igo Tatenai, omogabana bw’orogongo orwo rwa bosongo y’orooche rw’Eufarati, na Setari‐Bosenai, na abagabana bande baare kogamba amo nabarabwo ase orogongo orwo bagatoma riruube ase Dario omorwoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakamotomera amang’ana ariikire iga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "“Ase Dario omorwoti, omorembe bwonsi obe asore!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nigo togokomanyia aye omorwoti ng’a intwe ntwagenda ase orogongo orwo rw’Abayuda, ase enyomba ya Nyasae oyore omonene. Nigo egendererete koagacherwa amagena amanene mono, ne chibao chibekire ase chinyasi. Ekeene, emeremo eye nigo egokorwa ase okwerwa okonene, na nigo esesenirie ase amaboko abo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Agwo ntwakwana nabagaaka baria, tokababoria iga: Ning’o obaa ribaga mokoagacha enyomba eye na gokoora koagacha orwaki oro?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende ntwababoria amarieta abo, erinde tokorikere amarieta ’abatang’ani abwo babo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Amang’ana aya naro batoteebia: Intwe nigo tore abasomba ba Nyasae o igoro na ense, na nigo tokoagacha naende enyomba eria omorwoti omonene bw’Abaisraeli aagachete na akayekoora ase emiaka emenge yaetire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ekiagera chisokoro chiaito chiagerete Nyasae o igoro akaba nendamwamu, ere akabeeka abanto baria ase okoboko kwa Nebukadinesaro Omokalidayo, omorwoti o Babiloni, oria osaretie enyomba eye na akaira abanto Babiloni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ase omwaka bw’eritang’ani bw’okogamba gwa Koresi, omorwoti o Babiloni, ere Koresi naruete ogochika ng’a enyomba eye eagachwe naende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ebikorero bi’enyomba ya Nyasae biaroisirie korwa ase chitaabu ne chifeta, ebio Nebukadinesaro arusetie korwa ase Hekalu yarenge aiga Yerusalemu, akabiira akabibeka ase Hekalu yare Babiloni. Ebikorero ebio omorwoti Koresi akabirusia ase Hekalu ya Babiloni, akabia omonto okorokwa Sesibasari oyo abegete koba omogabana,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akamoteebia ng’a arente ebikorero ebio, abibeke ime ase Hekalu ere aiga Yerusalemu, naende atige enyomba ya Nyasae eagachwe aase yarenge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono Sesibasari nere ochagete kobeeka oboroso bw’enyomba ya Nyasae ere aiga Yerusalemu, na korwa engaki eyio goika reero iga, enyomba eye nigo egendererete koagachwa, teraera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gaki bono, aye omorwoti, onye amang’ana aya agokogwenera, ochike obotuki bokorwe ase amagachero e chibuku chi’oborwoti bwa Babiloni, omanye gose Koresi omorwoti naruete ogochika ng’a enyomba ya Nyasae ere Yerusalemu eagachwe naende. Aye omorwoti ototomere aya orengereretie igoro y’amang’ana aya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
